  "body": "Fixes #7812\n\n## Problem\n`fetchImages()` in `pkgs/id/web/src/image-browser.ts` bare-cast the `/api/images` response `as ImageEntry[]`. A wrong-shape 200 (deploy skew / future contract change) then:\n- wiped the grid before any validation,\n- dumped a raw engine `TypeError` into the dialog via the catch handler, or\n- rendered bogus `undefined` cards whose Insert created an image node with undefined src/alt.\n\n## Fix\n- `parseImageEntries()` validates the payload against the server contract (`pkgs/id/src/web/routes.rs` `images_list_handler`: a bare array of `{hash, name, url: string, size: number}`) inside `fetchImages()`, before any grid mutation — all-or-nothing: one malformed element rejects the whole payload with a clean `unexpected response from /api/images` error.\n- The catch handler now renders only `err.message`, never raw exception text.\n\n## Tests (oracle: the routes.rs ImageEntry contract)\n- New regression cases in `image-browser.test.ts`: null body, non-array object body, string body, null element, wrong-typed field, missing field, and a mixed valid+invalid array — each asserts no cards, Insert stays disabled, and no `TypeError`/`undefined` text. All 7 fail pre-fix, pass post-fix.\n- `image-browser.test.ts`: 20/20 pass.\n- Full web suite: 676 pass, 9 skipped, 1 failure in `search-panel.test.ts` (accessibility role test) — verified pre-existing on clean main `db27c4ed3b` with these changes stashed.\n- `tsc --noEmit` clean.\n\nQueue task 13991 (repo-health-code-pilot, lane code-p, direct).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796765427&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7815&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7815&signature=4d19a6d34ccd36d2cb2cde9dd78f839625020dd8ed0f575e12ad63860d2d7c82\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7815?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
